  "details": "Video players in vrchat outright refuse to work for me. Anytime I try loading a YouTube video, it sometimes manages to bypass whatever ban I have but fails most of the time to play any yt links.\n\nAfter going through all solutions the community and other tools have told me, I've come to the conclusion my ip may be denied from accessing YouTube through 3rd party tools such as yt-dlp...\n\nIf there was a way to link my yt account, to show proof that I pay for yt premium would be nice....since I don't wish for my experience to be ruined because youtube (google) believes I'm bypassing their ads.\n\nThanks,\n\nUwunice.",
